  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/2b14b34a-b7c6-4302-aa6e-067dffa3309c.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.93333in;height:1.69375in\" /><br />Solving, <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, the required area is <math><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
